Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End Move along, Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, are you almost done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that\NCommoner doing? Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have all day,\NRay Taylor. Hurry up! Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray Taylor is what I've\Nbeen called since I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was reincarnated in my\Nfavorite dating sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Telling the villainess of the game I was\Nin love with her kinda complicated things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I'm remade and loving every\Nminute I get to spend by your side.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.59,0:00:34.88,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.85,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.01,0:00:40.81,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.10,0:00:43.99,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.99,0:00:46.95,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.95,0:00:49.98,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.98,0:00:53.00,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.32,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.32,0:00:59.21,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I think I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think I'm feeling it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.21,0:01:01.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too hard, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.33,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to say happy ending?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.33,0:01:05.17,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.17,0:01:07.58,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.62,0:01:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an innocent word.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.77,0:01:11.09,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.09,0:01:13.59,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's true!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.84,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.18,0:01:19.60,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.81,0:01:21.47,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, if you're a guy who has yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.47,0:01:27.71,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't have a feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.35,0:01:30.32,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, make your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just the happy hour of happiness.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.32,0:01:34.11,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.11,0:01:39.07,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just the same one from the heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.07,0:01:40.95,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the heart be formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.95,0:01:43.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.70,0:01:47.00,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei-chan-han, one more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.79,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.79,0:01:52.42,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei-chan-han, one more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.42,0:01:56.30,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die until I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you! I love you!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.30,0:01:59.14,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
