Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until now, you's been the only\None who could challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you resign, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.86,0:02:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your tongue when\Nspeaking to Prince Rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To answer your question,\NI'm not resigning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good, but not better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw that coming, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Halfway through, you\Nstarted playing to counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't aware that you\Nhad a knack for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither was I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:03:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are all commoners chess\Nmasters like you? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is actually the first\Ntime I've ever tried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were that good on your first go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the rules on how to play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just never played\Non an actual chess set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise, I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Revolution, there's an\NAI chess game you can play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It allows you to challenge\Nany of the characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, I played\Nthe heck out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First the magic exams, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're full of surprises,\Naren't you, Ray Taylor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks for the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we be on our way now, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's play again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when we do, no need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows I was going easy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.74,0:03:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to make it weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just really, really need\Nto lower his affection level.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:04:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Yu, would you care for some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to try any of these sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you pull out of this out\Nof all the moves you could have made?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move the queen to f4.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should steer the whole\Ngame in your direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your\Nunsolicited advice However,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ask that you not distract me during\Na match Especially to suggest a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to make my apologies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hate to see Ray\Nbeing so unfair to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is deliberately putting you on the\Noffensive to walk you into her trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hoping to win\Nwith cowardly tactics?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.76,0:04:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But every time we play, you're on the\Nattack, so I thought I'd change it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, Glare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we give it a rest for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I tempt you with some poker?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Deed, you'll be our dealer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an honor, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming, Misha,\Nand on short notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, Misha's a\Nproper busy lady, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be honored\Nshe showed up for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be rude, Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accept my apologies, Prince Hugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to give her a talking-to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I don't mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you can feel free to adopt\Na more informal approach with me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As students, we are all on the same level!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Miss Claire, did you see\Nwhat I saw? They're pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together aren't they i think\Ni may have caught a whiff of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,love in the air why is every\Nsingle idea that pops into
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your mind so dreadfully vulgar\Naren't they adorable they were
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really good friends as children\Nthey remain quite close
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until misha's family fell on\Nhard times we're not supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know but Misha's got a pretty\Nhardcore crush on him. You are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allowed to swap out cards up to\Ntwo times there are no chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only object of the game is to\Nhave the strongest hand showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One draw away from a street.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to swap out one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is a poker face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Misha has got it down\Nto an art. Tell me, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whilst playing chess with Rod earlier,\Nwere you holding back so he could win?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You threw the game for the\Nprince's benefit? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear that guy gives me\Ntoo much credit. My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You truly are quite a fascinating girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, don't hold back in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have one card I'd\Ncare to swap, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she gets any cuter, I might explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's clearly got a great hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stick with the cards I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're on to the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swap or stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even swapping out a single card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have a really good hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, then a straight\Nwon't be enough to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need to swap them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a risky move so\Nearly on, but I have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see Miss\NClaire's frustrated face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're ready to show hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called trash! Biggie food!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not your lucky day, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Misha?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, three of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The look on your face says you've\Nalso got an impressive hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A full house, in fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm living for that laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, looks like it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just four of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's incredible, Prince Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that an ace of hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had one of those in my original hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dealer is Prince Yu's attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This game was totes rigged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, is there something\Nyou'd like to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on to you, Prince Charlotan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit that's not\Nthe response I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fascinating girl indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you do something underhanded again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I was good, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, shouldn't we get going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, we're gonna\Nlose Misha to the dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that sound. Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope there's a reason\Nfor your bellowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't drag me behind you like a dog. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, my gift to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:08:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All alone playing a harp?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not as random as it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of his game events.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.10,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(456,810)\fnBreezeSans\fs40\b0\c&HF4FCFA&\3c&H986542&\1a&H19&\3a&H19&\blur0.8\clip(435,795,453,864)\t(27,403,\clip(435,795,1140,864))}It's nothing worth subjecting others to.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.10,0:09:10.11,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,680)\fs35\bord2\c&HF8F7E9&\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H32&\3a&H32&\blur1}Thane
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.10,0:09:10.11,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,680)\fs35\c&H840800&\1a&H32&\blur1}Thane
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out that broody Prince\NThane has mad harp skills.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.15,0:09:10.11,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(459,810)\fnBreezeSans\fs40\b0\c&HF4FCFA&\3c&H986542&\1a&H19&\3a&H19&\blur0.8\clip(435,795,453,960)\t(21,814,\clip(435,795,1800,960))}This is merely a pastime.\NIt has nothing to do with being a good king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The protagonist has the option\Nto compliment him on it, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.15,0:09:12.36,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(462,810)\fnBreezeSans\fs40\b0\c&HF4FCFA&\3c&H986542&\1a&H19&\3a&H19&\blur0.8\clip(435,795,453,864)\t(27,403,\clip(435,795,1140,864))}Thane then put down the harp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the most beautiful\Nsound I've ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as you started\Nplaying, I felt less alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a gift for harpsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have made a\Nbigger mistake if she tried.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.08,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,680)\fs35\bord2\c&HF8F7E9&\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H32&\3a&H32&\blur1}Thane
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.08,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,680)\fs35\c&H840800&\1a&H32&\blur1}Thane
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.13,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(462,810)\fnBreezeSans\fs40\b0\c&HF4FCFA&\3c&H986542&\1a&H19&\3a&H19&\blur0.8\clip(435,795,453,864)\t(27,403,\clip(435,795,1140,864))}You've been listening, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to raise his affection level,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:32.13,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(459,810)\fnBreezeSans\fs40\b0\c&HF4FCFA&\3c&H986542&\1a&H19&\3a&H19&\blur0.8\clip(435,795,453,960)\t(21,814,\clip(435,795,1800,960))}Oh, no. I was trying to stay out of the way, but Thane noticed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got to listen to the whole\Nthing before approaching him.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.13,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,680)\fs35\bord2\c&HF8F7E9&\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H32&\3a&H32&\blur1}Thane
Dialogue: 2,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.13,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,680)\fs35\c&H840800&\1a&H32&\blur1}Thane
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.13,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(462,810)\fnBreezeSans\fs40\b0\c&HF4FCFA&\3c&H986542&\1a&H19&\3a&H19&\blur0.8\clip(435,795,453,864)\t(27,403,\clip(435,795,1140,864))}Why didn't you say anything?
Dialogue: 2,0:09:34.13,0:09:38.13,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(1220,185)\fnAver\fs64\fsp1\bord1\3c&H4D411E&\3a&H14&\blur1.6}Affection Level for Claire
Dialogue: 3,0:09:34.13,0:09:38.13,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(1220,185)\fnAver\fs64\fsp1\3c&HA58328&\blur1}Affection Level for Claire
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.14,0:09:38.14,Signs,Mask,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\c&HAF7C1D&\blur1\p1}m 862.29 170.86 l 862.29 168.57 862.29 166.29 863.43 164.57 864.57 162.86 866.29 161.14 868 160 1566.22 159.11 1568.89 159.11 1572.44 160 1575.11 161.78 1576.89 165.33 1578.67 168.89 1579.56 258.67 1578.67 263.11 1577.78 266.67 1575.11 268.44 1571.56 270.22 1567.11 271.11 872 271.11 869.14 270.29 866.29 268 864 266.29 862.29 263.43
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not engage him while he's in the zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hates that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you finished playing already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is nothing worth subjecting others to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a frivolous pastime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do\Nwith being a good king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we play a game that will\Ntest your suitability to become king?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of game could test something\Nso complex? Perhaps chess? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's much more innovative. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is called the king game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the king game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all draw lots with numbers on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if you draw the number one,\Nthat means you're the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess what the king does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numbers X and Y have to do Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He or she gets to give\Norders to everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we expect to know which one of\Nus will be the best ruler after playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the king now? My\Nword. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a standard part of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all have to say it\Nwhen it's time to reveal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the results of the drawing\Nand crown the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us? No exceptions.\NNo exceptions. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see okay are we ready to\Ntry this for realsies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:11:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the king? Now it is\NI—that's right, you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the king Prince Thane so give your orders
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then numbers two and\Nthree I order you to hold hands
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have been cursed with number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king ordered me to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do what we must for hand and country\NI didn't order you to go that far
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the king now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's me this time very\Nwell in a let's get on with it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, number four, must pat number\Nthree lovingly on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is me, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, and I'm number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that crosses the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe one should touch\Na lady's hair without consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you most certainly have\Nmy consent, Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, if I may...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unto the third round!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the king now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny takes a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what shall be my first degree?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of ridiculous\Norder is she going to give?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Solanae's number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rey, what on earth are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you wanna cheat? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one of us becomes king,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the other one has to do is signal\Nwhat her number is by blinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which will let us know what Miss Claire\Nand Prince Thane's numbers are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, boom, we give them a spicy\Norder that makes the magic happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess we could, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She loves Miss Claire,\Nso why is she doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I've decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My order is that number two\Nand number four must kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numbers two and four must kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on a moment, commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sure you know that\Norder is - Absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that tends to be the\Ncase with the king's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what you're waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray Taylor, you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This game has nothing to\Ndo with being a good king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you mocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't get anything past\Nyou, can we? Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You correctly deduced\Nthat this game has nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do with whether you'll\Nbe a great king someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:14:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it happens, the true objective was to\Nsee how long it took you to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying it was a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that, I humbly\Nask for your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the bright side,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you refused to comply with\Nan unreasonable order,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you successfully\Nidentified my true intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say you have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a true king could\Nsort through all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Zane, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, was this whole thing really a test?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, I lied. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deceptive snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, at least I managed to\Nscore you some sweet headpacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:15:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, tell me, am I correct in assuming\Nthat you're what they call gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Misha,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think that's an awfully\Npersonal question to ask in this setting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an awfully personal question\Nfor any setting if you ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me to\Ntalk about it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you are my best\Nfriend, so I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I mean, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it means I like girls, then yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been in love with a guy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't look so\Ngood, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sensing that I am in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand you might be leery of\NRei, given how she often behaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Miss Claire, to react that\Nway just because she's gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says more about your ignorance\Nthan it does her character.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's say, as an example,\Nthat you are straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am straight, Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're madly in love with\NPrince Thane, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who mad-loved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:15:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, the jokes aren't helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, tell me, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you feel if a man came up to\Nyou and said, Don't molest me? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never conduct myself\Nin a lecherous manner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, you basically\Naccused Ray of the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you were in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're so right, Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one lusts after everyone who\Nfits their gender preference.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if\Nyou're gay or straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attraction is based on the individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying you fall in love with\Nthe person and not their gender, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And currently, the one you're in\Nlove with just happens to be a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say gender\Ndoesn't matter at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the logic behind\Nsaying gender doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter when you deeply\Nconnect with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, love is love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can say for sure that I'll never\Nhave those kinds of feelings for a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess all of this is more\Ncomplicated than people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people never have\Nthe chance to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't help that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know Miss Clara\Ndoesn't feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy to bask in her presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you ever change your mind and\Nyou want to make out, just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's because you\Ncontinue to say those things
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I feel like I have to\Nremain forever on my guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the record, I agree with every\Npart of that last bit. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't ever expect anyone\Nto reciprocate my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one who's\Nbeen unlucky in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish your thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you about to say you've\Ngiven up on Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I not supposed to respond\Nto this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they realize I'm mere inches away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm a little\Nconfused about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, from the\Nway you've been acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assumed you were in\Nlove with Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:18:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then you suggested we cheat in that\Ngame to help her get close to Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I believe I heard\Nsomething I cannot overlook!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that could be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I said anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have never thought of it in that way\Nbefore, that I would be giving up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always known she's straight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's not as though I expected us\Nto ride off into the sunset together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire has chosen someone she\Nloves, and I want to support her in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm honestly\Nhappy just being around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But most importantly, it was never\Nabout being physical with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't my end goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is to make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genuinely happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're questioning whether I can give\Nup on something that brings me so much joy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:19:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't worry about me, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just keep treating me\Nthe way you always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I am content with our\Nrelationship exactly as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beef bowls, extra large servings today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking about all those super complex\Nsubjects made me anxious and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get a beef bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you get one for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beef bowls have been acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you one, too,\Njust in case you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's definitely as it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See nothing's changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world of happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though almost no one I've loved\Nhas ever returned my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I don't tell them how\NI feel they'll remain in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the moment I fall in\Nlove I lose them completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's that Commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who's been pursuing Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though they're both girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's my behavior that's\Ncreating their prejudice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do the princes even talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose strange people\Nmake for good entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like anyone could ever\Nbe attracted to a freak like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep making jokes about\Nthe rejection, I can hold it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can be awfully clumsy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I wasn't paying attention\Nand my hand must have slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alright though, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did that on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said you're alright, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've dawdled over your meal long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've finished eating, I\Nhave several things to get done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that Miss\NClaire would stand up for Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, I don't know if I'd\Ncall that standing up for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.42,0:21:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may not have meant to,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Miss Claire did something\Nwrong, and she realizes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It left her feeling unsettled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though, two girls happen to\Ncome along spouting insults,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,providing the perfect target on which to\Nrelease all of that self-directed anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire is still very much a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avoid the pickled ginger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is way too sour to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's supposed to be sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have some sort of problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not really, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I want to know\Nif you still hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:21:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I still hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I still love you!
