Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.66,0:23:14.05,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how much I say it, it'll never, ever be enough!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.05,0:23:15.08,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I love you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.08,0:23:18.12,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Choice or no choice, I'd still tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.12,0:23:20.73,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Joy, gratitude, appreciation, happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.45,0:23:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you just want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.73,0:23:21.99,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I wanna express everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.99,0:23:24.64,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Even if it's just for a minute or just for a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.98,0:23:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what you're doing. I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.64,0:23:25.55,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I wanna be by your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy for the first time!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.73,0:23:31.58,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}Oh! She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to be here!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.58,0:23:35.62,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}You never existed like this in the world I'm from,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.82,0:23:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world that you're living in\Nthe world is used to be a miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to teach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.64,0:23:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to break you down.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.30,0:23:44.70,ed_eng_03_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}I want to be right here next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,practice my magic skills for next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.28,0:23:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you suggesting that even\Na tool caster needs to prepare?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with protag specs, I still\Ncan't afford to slack off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.08,0:23:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love, effort, victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So on the note, give me your love!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!
